7. 🧠 DATA SCIENCE, GENERATIVE AI & SOFTWARE ARCHITECTURE:
   - PyTorch, Transformers, LLM Fine-Tuning (PEFT, LoRA, QLoRA), Vector DBs, RAG Systems
